 quiet life in seclusion, suspicious of outsiders, and hesitant to give their trust. Accessible only by the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">GCTS</a>, the Gnomebase is in fact part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>. Gnomegate is physically located below <a href=\"#/wiki/Ferngrims%20Gate\">Ferngrims Gate</a> and the ocean between <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32795,31771,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32795, 31771, 10)</a>.\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomebase%20Alpha\">Gnomebase Alpha</a> is a separate part of <b>Gnomegate</b>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Gnomegate NPCs (24 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bigfoot%20Soldier\">Bigfoot Soldier</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bigfoot%20Soldier\"><img alt=\"Bigfoot Soldier\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bigfoot_Soldier_72fb47.gif\" width=\"97\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Guard</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gnomegate</strong>, far to the south</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Commander%20Stone\">Commander Stone</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><sp